<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 2.38 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate falls to 2.38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell slightly to 2.38 percent on Monday from 2.46 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said nine banks traded on the market in 21 reported transactions with a total value of 27.57 million dinars ($38.9 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
